  "description": "Our Goodship road bike frame is back.\n\nWe designed it to be a forward-looking, elegant, functional and adaptable frame that can be ridden daily with confidence – year after year. The Goodship embraces the exquisite ride and resilience of Reynolds 725 steel. You’ll enjoy proven modern appointments that make the Goodship practical and fast, without getting caught up in the fickle chase of the latest here-today-gone-tomorrow pro racing tech. After all, what really matters on a ride is the experience. The feel of the ride, the enjoyment of the ride, and durability to ride again tomorrow. The Goodship will give you the desire to push harder, find new roads, and importantly, it will inspire you to get out there again tomorrow.\n\nRoad focused geometry\n\nReynolds 725 tubing throughout\n\nClearance for 700x35 tires\n\nInternal routing starting behind the head tube\n\nCompatible with electronic and mechanical groupsets\n\nFlat-mount disc\n\nUDH dropout\n\nT-47 bottom bracket\n\nZS44│EC44 headset\n\nRack and fender mounts\n\nFull ED coating\n\nNOTE: The Goodship frame comes with: assorted port hole covers (for mechanical or wireless shifting), low-profile stainless bottle cage and rack bolts, low-profile stainless fender bolts, internal housing damper sleeves, 31.8mm clamp-on derailleur cable stop, Stick-On cable guides for Di2, and a M12x172x1.0T UDH axle.",
